  "body": "While the WPT tests appear to test a few things with deleted File/Directory handles (like that values() on a deleted directory returns NotFoundError), there's no spec text that I see to specify what happens to an existing File/DirectoryHandle when it's removeEntry()'d from it's parent.   Ditto SyncAccessHandles.     \r\nAlso: what happens if an async method is still in progress?",
